      "writtenOn": "2024-11-25T07:08:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Override mutator will redirect the dependency edge of\n```\nautogenerated_rro_override_app --\u003e override_app\n```\nto\n```\nautogenerated_rro_override_app --\u003e app{override:override_app} # override variant of the aosp app\n```\n\nThe override variant of the base app should contain the necessary providers for rroDirs. This CL also has a unit test for that.\n\nIn my current implementation, I am using the output file tags to get the manifest, and I think such redirection does not happen for output files.",
      "parentUuid": "f5eb1bb7_f6221dc6",
      "revId": "4b20fd83b4573110a19ff202127b793f6c850eb7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
