        "id": 1535516
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-25T19:17:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e In my current implementation, I am using the output file tags to get the manifest, and I think such redirection does not happen for output files.\n\nCould we dig into this a little more? The dependency edge is redirected, and dependencies are a module-level thing, not a provider-level thing, so I don\u0027t understand why you\u0027d see the redirect on all providers except OutputFiles.",
      "parentUuid": "f0e70445_2619b0f6",
      "revId": "4b20fd83b4573110a19ff202127b793f6c850eb7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
